{"hymn":"S101","parent":"E1098","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":1},"title":"Estamos rebosando","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su victoria y exaltación","syl":{"n1":["Es","i"],"n2":["ta","m"],"n3":["mos","t"],"n4":["re","i"],"n5":["bo","m"],"n6":["san","m"],"n7":["do","t"],"n8":"Con","n9":"la","n10":["pa","i"],"n11":["la‿bra","t"],"n12":["bue","i"],"n13":["na,","t"],"n15":"De","n16":["nues","i"],"n17":["tra","t"],"n18":["ex","i"],"n19":["pe","m"],"n20":["rien","m"],"n21":["cia","t"],"n22":"Con","n23":["nues","i"],"n24":["tro‿a","m"],"n25":["ma","m"],"n26":["do","t"],"n27":"Rey.","n28":"Con","n29":["len","i"],"n30":["gua","t"],"n31":["co","i"],"n32":["mo","t"],"n33":["plu","i"],"n34":["ma","t"],"n35":["De‿á","i"],"n36":["gil","t"],"n37":["es","i"],"n38":["cri","m"],"n40":["bien","m"],"n41":["te,","t"],"n43":["Na","i"],"n44":["rra","m"],"n45":["mos","t"],"n46":"las","n47":["de","i"],"n48":["li","m"],"n49":["cias","t"],"n50":"De","n51":["nues","i"],"n52":["tro","t"],"n53":["No","i"],"n54":["vio","t"],"n55":"fiel."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Jesús, el más hermoso","De los hijos de hombres;","Con Tu bondad trasciendes","¡Aleluya! Amén!","Se derramó‿en Tus labios","Tan abundante gracia,","Por eso te bendijo","El Dios de Israel."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Tú eres el Valiente,","Cabalgas en victoria;","En gloria majestuosa","Triunfantemente vas.","Bajo de Ti los pueblos","Caerán por Tus conquistas;","Tus saetas agudas","Pasaron por Satán."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Tu trono,‿oh Dios, por siempre","Perdurará inmutable;","Y‿el cetro de Tu reino","Firme en la tierra está.","Con óleo de alegría","El Dios Tuyo te ungió","Más que a Tus compañeros.","Grande es Tu dignidad!"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Mirra, áloe y casia","Exhalan Tus vestidos,","Ellos van prediciendo","Muerte y resurrección.","En todas las iglesias","(Palacios de marfil),","Los santos te alaban","Con grande exaltación."]}]}